# shell: desktop
# apps: fixture
# AW-047/AW-045: the Open With window is single-selection and list only,
# its buttons live from the selection, Return opens, and Escape cancels.
wait 8
click-row 1
wait 2
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
menu-pick Open with…
wait 8
expect-windows 2
note the best claim leads the list; Down takes it and Return opens
key Down
wait 2
key Return
wait 25
expect-file /tmp/trk_launched
expect-windows 1
note asked again, Escape is the whole answer
click-row 1
wait 2
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
menu-pick Open with…
wait 8
expect-windows 2
key Escape
wait 5
expect-windows 1
note an application that does not claim the type asks first (AW-046)
remove /tmp/trk_launched
click-row 1
wait 2
press-row 1 3
wait 2
release-row 1 3
wait 5
menu-pick Open with
wait 3
menu-pick Open with…
wait 8
key Down
wait 2
key Down
wait 2
key Return
wait 5
expect-alert does not claim
key o
wait 25
expect-file /tmp/trk_launched
quit
